Subject: [PATCH 03/79] fix: add mc gdk patchset

Ported to the CrossOver 26.3 tree from 0002-fix-add-mc-gdk-patchset.patch. The CredEnumerateW hunks are dropped: Highball's 0019 already treats an empty host keychain as success.
